### Goal Model for Multi-Robot Food Delivery System

#### Goals Table

| Goal ID | Goal Title                | Text                                                                 | Runtime Annotation               | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|---------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1      | Deliver Food              | Ensure food delivery from kitchen to inpatient room.                 | -                                | Achieve   | -        |
| G2      | Determine Retrieval Method| Decide how the food will be retrieved by the inpatient or others.    | FALLBACK(G3, G4)                 | Query     | G1       |
| G3      | Inpatient Retrieves Food  | Enable inpatient to retrieve food directly from robot tray.          | -                                | Achieve   | G2       |
| G4      | Assist with Retrieval     | Facilitate food retrieval by companion, nurse, or another robot.    | FALLBACK(G4.1, G4.2, G4.3)       | Achieve   | G2       |
| G5      | Track Meal Retrieval      | Monitor which meal is retrieved and alert on incorrect retrieval.   | -                                | Perform   | G1       |
| G6      | Retrieve Dirty Dishes     | Collect dirty dishes from the room.                                  | FALLBACK(G6.1, G6.2)             | Achieve   | G1       |
| G7      | Coordinate Door Operations| Handle door operations for delivery and dish retrieval.              | FALLBACK(G7.1, G7.2)             | Achieve   | G1       |

#### Tasks Table

| Task ID | Task Title                   | Text                                                                 | Relation | Location       | Number of Robots |
|---------|------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------|----------------|------------------|
| AT1     | Check Inpatient Capability   | Verify if inpatient can retrieve food from tray.                     | AND      | Inpatient Room | 1                |
| AT2     | Notify Companion/Nurse       | Inform companion or nurse about the delivery for assistance.         | OR       | Inpatient Room | [1, 1]           |
| AT3     | Indicate Meal to Retrieve    | Display which meal should be retrieved by inpatient or helper.       | AND      | Inpatient Room | 1                |
| AT4     | Track Meal Retrieval         | Log when and where each meal was retrieved.                          | AND      | Inpatient Room | 1                |
| AT5     | Alert Incorrect Retrieval    | Notify if a wrong meal is retrieved.                                 | AND      | Inpatient Room | 1                |
| AT6     | Collect Dishes               | Retrieve dirty dishes from the room.                                 | OR       | Inpatient Room | [1, 2]           |
| AT7     | Coordinate with Robot        | Work with another robot to collect dishes.                           | OR       | Inpatient Room | [2, 2]           |
| AT8     | Coordinate with Human        | Work with a human to collect dishes.                                 | OR       | Inpatient Room | [1, 1]           |
| AT9     | Open Door                    | Manage door opening for delivery or dish retrieval.                  | OR       | Entrance       | [1, 1]           |
| AT10    | Coordinate Door with Robot   | Work with another robot to open the door.                            | OR       | Entrance       | [2, 2]           |
| AT11    | Coordinate Door with Human   | Work with a human to open the door.                                  | OR       | Entrance       | [1, 1]           |

#### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G5, G6, G7 [AND]**
- **G2 -> G3, G4 [FALLBACK]**
- **G3 -> AT1, AT3 [AND]**
- **G4 -> AT2, AT3 [FALLBACK]**
- **G5 -> AT4, AT5 [AND]**
- **G6 -> G6.1, G6.2 [FALLBACK]**
- **G6.1 -> AT6 [AND]**
- **G6.2 -> AT7, AT8 [FALLBACK]**
- **G7 -> G7.1, G7.2 [FALLBACK]**
- **G7.1 -> AT9 [AND]**
- **G7.2 -> AT10, AT11 [FALLBACK]**
